 ition] ICCN 2026 - Conference (estimated)
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: International Conference on Cognitive Neurody
 namics\nWebsite: https://iccn2026.jp/\nSource URL: https://iccn2026.jp/\n
 Location: Osaka\, Japan\nTopics: Computational Neuroscience\, Cognitive S
 cience & Computational Cognition\, Nonlinear Dynamics & Chaos\, Complex S
 ystems & Network Science\nSize: M\nSubmission type: Abstract-based\; publ
 ication unconfirmed\nConfidence: estimated\nLast checked date: 2026-10-08
 \nNotes: The organizer page body lists October 22-25\, while its metadata
  says October 27-30\, and the live domain was unreachable on review. Date
 s remain provisional pending organizer confirmation. No submission deadli
 ne or current proceedings promise was verified. Earlier editions have Spr
 inger edited proceedings\; do not confuse this series with clinical neuro
 physiology congresses also abbreviated ICCN. Size is an editorial estimat
 e.\nScope: Cognitive neurodynamics and the relation between neural dynami
