 al and computational neuroscience with nonlinear dynamics and complex neu
 ral systems. Current submission and publication details require organizer
  confirmation\; historical edited proceedings are not a guarantee for 202
 6.\nAdditional topics: Systems & Experimental Neuroscience\nScope sources
  (2026): https://iccn2026.jp/\, https://link.springer.com/book/10.1007/97
 8-981-16-0317-4\nScope last checked: 2026-10-08
